      "value": "Note: this still has not been resolved with the \"Safety Options\" feature, that has been added couple weeks ago. I can block avatars for a trust level, but if the download has already been started (e.g. decided to block avatars *after* entering a world), it's going to continue downloading in the background, and avatars might reappear after the download has finished.",
